    "sections": {
        "description": "The Cleaning Services Agent WordPress Theme is a versatile and professional tool designed for cleaning agencies and service providers. Tailored for businesses offering residential, commercial, and industrial cleaning, this theme helps showcase services like house cleaning, office cleaning, deep cleaning, and green cleaning. With its sleek and modern design, the theme offers a polished and trustworthy online presence, making it perfect for companies that provide everything from carpet and upholstery cleaning to pressure washing and sanitising services. The layout is intuitive and user-friendly, featuring customizable sections such as “About Us” to highlight your team’s expertise and “Testimonials” to build credibility with real customer reviews. High-quality image and video galleries allow you to present your cleaning techniques, tools, and before-and-after results, engaging visitors with impactful visuals. This theme is packed with features to enhance functionality and user experience. WooCommerce compatibility enables agencies to offer cleaning packages or sell supplies online. Translation readiness ensures accessibility for diverse audiences, while social media integration increases visibility and engagement. The theme’s responsive design guarantees seamless browsing on all devices, allowing users to book services like move-in/move-out cleaning, post-construction cleaning, or customized cleaning packages effortlessly. SEO-friendly code and fast loading times improve search engine rankings, ensuring your services are easily discoverable."
    },
